# Saved latents and rendered output live next to the notebook, but must not be committed:
# a sweep is ~2 MB per level (tens of MB per run), and it is fully reproducible from the notebook.
#   levels_*.pt   final checkpoint, written when the run completes
#   partial_*.pt  written after every rejuvenation sweep, so a preempted run is still usable
#   *.pt.tmp      the temp file CheckpointingPCNKernel renames from (atomic write)
*.pt
*.pt.tmp
decoded/
*.png
